-- A journey the spec cannot decide, which is a different answer from one it
-- refuses. `Member.is_at_limit` is derived from a count of loans, and nothing
-- here has set it.

journey NobodySaidWhetherSheIsAtHerLimit {
    goal: The limit is a derived value nothing set, so whether she may borrow
          at all is a question this tool cannot answer.

    cast:
        ada:  Member
        copy: catalogue/Copy

    given:
        copy.status = available

    1. she tries to borrow it
        ada does MemberBorrows(ada, copy) on MemberShelf
        then BorrowCopy fires
        then ReturnCopy fires

    ends: Nobody knows.
}
